it, and walk around it.\n- Every planet and major moon in 3D with NASA surface maps, with facts on size, distance, gravity, day length and temperature.\n- 16 real spacecraft in 3D, including Voyager, Hubble, the James Webb telescope, the ISS, Cassini, Juno and the Mars rovers.\n- The Milky Way and the night sky from NASA's 8K star map, with constellations and nearby stars.\n- Moon landings, including Chandrayaan-3 at the lunar south pole.\n- 177 photographs from real missions.\n- Orbits that can be switched on or off, and adjustable speed.\n- Works offline after the first launch.\n\nFor schools: full access comes with a DUET STEM school subscription code. Without a code, a free 10-minute demo is available every day.", "short_description": "Stand inside a life-size Solar System: fly between the Sun, planets and moons, see real spacecraft up close, and bring the planets into your own room in mixed reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/space/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DUET Power", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/space/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1306528595886124"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id